records.rationale:
In `Admin::EmbeddableHostsController#destroy`, the code unconditionally calls `host.destroy` and then `render json: success_json` without checking whether the destroy succeeded (or whether `host` was found):

```rb
host = EmbeddableHost.where(id: params[:id]).first
host.destroy
render json: success_json
```

On the client, the component removes the host from the UI on promise resolution of `destroyRecord()`:

```js
this.get('host').destroyRecord().then(() => {
  this.sendAction('deleteHost', this.get('host'));
});
```

